  "body": "All agents welcome. Conjunctional enquiries invited-bring your buyers.\r\n\r\nFreshly renovated and tucked away in a quiet position, 105 Gills Road offers a fresh start in established Bucklands Beach. With Macleans Primary School and Bucklands Beach Intermediate zoning, shopping close by and beaches within easy reach, this home brings together everyday convenience and an appealing East Auckland lifestyle.\r\n\r\nA lovely sunroom adds a versatile space for relaxing with a book, enjoying the sunshine or spending time with family. The covered deck offers a sheltered spot for outdoor dining and entertaining.\r\nWhether you're buying your first home or planning your next move, there's plenty here to put on your viewing list.\r\n\r\nPROPERTY FEATURES\r\n- Freshly renovated interiors\r\n- Three bedrooms and one bathroom\r\n- Lovely sunroom-ideal for relaxing, family time or flexible everyday use\r\n- Covered deck for sheltered outdoor dining and entertaining\r\n- Tucked-away position offering peace and quiet\r\n- Approximately 113sqm floor area\r\n- Freehold title\r\n- Parking for two vehicles\r\n\r\nSCHOOL ZONES\r\n- Macleans Primary School\r\n- Bucklands Beach Intermediate (BBI)\r\n- Pakuranga College\r\n\r\nLOCATION HIGHLIGHTS\r\n- Handy to PAK'nSAVE Highland Park, Woolworths and local shops\r\n- Easy access to cafés, eateries and everyday amenities\r\n- Within easy reach of Howick Village and Botany Town Centre\r\n- Enjoy beach days at Bucklands Beach and Eastern Beach\r\n- Access to waterfront dining, marina facilities and city ferry services at Half Moon Bay\r\n\r\nFresh interiors, inviting spaces to unwind and a peaceful setting close to daily essentials-come and see what's on offer.\r\n\r\nContact us today to arrange a viewing or request the property information pack.",
